- The 004 link parenthetical “článok 10” can simply be deleted. The reviewer is right that the URL is article 3 of the withholding-rate standards and that calling that URL article 10 is a bad label (Korean and English do the same). The digit 10 is still required because the Korean link text contains 제10조. The parenthetical was put back so the file passes.

